  "name": "Washington Square Hotel",
  "starRating": 3,
  "descriptions": [
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "RXLContentId",
      "text": "21604"
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "SurroundingArea",
      "text": "With a stay at Washington Square Hotel in New York (Manhattan), you\u0027ll be steps from 5th Avenue and Washington Square Park.  This family-friendly hotel is 0.5 mi (0.8 km) from New York University and 0.8 mi (1.2 km) from Chelsea Market."
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "RoomTypes",
      "text": "Make yourself at home in one of the 152 guestrooms featuring iPod docking stations and LCD televisions. Your pillowtop bed comes with Egyptian cotton sheets. Complimentary wireless internet access keeps you connected, and cable programming is available for your entertainment. Private bathrooms with shower/tub combinations feature deep soaking bathtubs and complimentary toiletries."
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "PropertyInformation",
      "text": "Pamper yourself with onsite massages and facials. This Art Deco hotel also features complimentary wireless internet access, concierge services, and a banquet hall."
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "AreaActivities",
      "text": "Distances are displayed to the nearest 0.1 mile and kilometer. \u003Cbr /\u003E \u003Cp\u003EWashington Square Park - 0.1 km / 0.1 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E 5th Avenue - 0.2 km / 0.1 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E New York University - 0.8 km / 0.5 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Union Square Park - 0.9 km / 0.6 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Holland Tunnel - 1.2 km / 0.7 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Chelsea Market - 1.2 km / 0.8 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Flatiron Building - 1.4 km / 0.9 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Whitney Museum of American Art - 1.5 km / 0.9 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Gramercy Park - 1.5 km / 1 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Chelsea Hotel - 1.7 km / 1 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Madison Square Park - 1.7 km / 1.1 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E The High Line Park - 1.7 km / 1.1 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Chelsea Piers - 1.9 km / 1.2 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Lower East Side Tenement Museum - 2.1 km / 1.3 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Empire State Building - 2.3 km / 1.4 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E \u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003EThe nearest airports are:\u003Cbr /\u003ELaGuardia Airport (LGA) - 16.5 km / 10.3 mi\u003Cbr /\u003E Teterboro, NJ (TEB) - 21 km / 13.1 mi\u003Cbr /\u003E Newark Liberty Intl. Airport (EWR) - 21.3 km / 13.2 mi\u003Cbr /\u003E John F. Kennedy Intl. Airport (JFK) - 29.7 km / 18.5 mi\u003Cbr /\u003E Linden, NJ (LDJ) - 31.2 km / 19.4 mi\u003Cbr /\u003E \u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003EThe preferred airport for Washington Square Hotel is John F. Kennedy Intl. Airport (JFK). \u003C/p\u003E"
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "PoliciesDisclaimers",
      "text": "\u003Cul\u003E  \u003Cli\u003EExtra-person charges may apply and vary depending on property policy\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGovernment-issued photo identification and a credit card, debit card, or cash deposit may be required at check-in for incidental charges\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESpecial requests are subject to availability upon check-in and may incur additional charges; special requests cannot be guaranteed\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThis property accepts credit cards; cash is not accepted\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECashless transactions are available\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESafety features at this property include a fire extinguisher, a security system, and a first aid kit\u003C/li\u003E  \u003C/ul\u003E \u003Cul\u003E  \u003Cli\u003EThis property\u0027s policy is to refuse certain bookings for the purpose of group events or parties, including pre-wedding stag/bachelor and hen/bachelorette parties. \u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EChildren 12 years old and younger stay free when occupying the parent or guardian\u0027s room, using existing bedding. \u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EOnly registered guests are allowed in the guestrooms. \u003C/li\u003E \u003Cli\u003ECashless payment methods are available for all transactions.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EContactless check-in and contactless check-out are available.\u003C/li\u003E \u003C/ul\u003E"
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "DiningFacilities",
      "text": "Stop by North Square Restaurant for lunch, dinner, or brunch, where this restaurant specializes in American cuisine, or grab snacks at the 2 coffee shops/cafes. Relax with a refreshing drink at one of the 2 bars/lounges."
    }
  ],
